00:20:32.364 --> 00:20:35.433
JEANETTE ETHERIDGE, THE LONGTIME OWNER OF SAN

00:20:35.433 --> 00:20:38.970
FRANCISCO'S TOSCA CAFE WHO RECENTLY PASSED AWAY AT THE AGE

00:20:38.970 --> 00:20:42.506
