00:20:42.506 --> 00:20:43.708
COLUMBUS AVENUE, JEANETTE ETHERIDGE SERVED AS THE

00:20:43.708 --> 00:20:46.911
PROPRIETOR OF TOSCA CAFE. SHE OWNED THE BAR BUT EVEN MORE

00:20:46.911 --> 00:20:50.515
SHE OWNED THE ROOM. SEAN PENN ONCE A REGULAR

00:20:50.515 --> 00:20:56.921
DESCRIBE JANETTE AS THE MOTHER AND MAYOR OF THE SAN FRANCISCO

00:20:56.921 --> 00:20:57.789
NIGHT. SHE WAS BORN IN CHINA.

00:20:57.789 --> 00:21:02.127
A SOMEWHAT SURPRISING FACT SHAPED BY HER FAMILY'S JOURNEY.

00:21:02.127 --> 00:21:05.730
HER PARENTS WERE THE CHILDREN OF ARMENIAN REFUGEES WHO FLED

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:07.640
THE GENOCIDE FIRST TO RUSSIA AND THEN TO CHINA.

00:21:07.640 --> 00:21:10.134
SHE SPOKE RUSSIAN, CHINESE AND JAPANESE BEFORE SHE EVER

00:21:10.134 --> 00:21:13.538
LEARNED ENGLISH. AS SHE MADE HER WAY TO SAN

00:21:13.538 --> 00:21:16.474
FRANCISCO. SHE ATTENDED THE SAN FRANCISCO

00:21:16.474 --> 00:21:17.475
ART INSTITUTE AND FOCUSED ON SCULPTURE.

00:21:17.475 --> 00:21:21.345
>> SHE FOUND THE PRACTICE, HOWEVER, TO BE TOO SOLITARY

00:21:21.345 --> 00:21:24.949
AND IN HER WORDS TOO DIFFICULT. >> FATE WOULD HAVE ANOTHER PLAN

00:21:24.949 --> 00:21:28.286
FOR HER WHEN SHE WAS CHATTING WITH THE THEN OWNER OF TOSCA

00:21:28.286 --> 00:21:32.220
CAFE WHO INFORMED HER THAT HE WAS GOING TO SHUT DOWN THE BAR

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:35.160
AND MOVE ON. SHE TOLD HER MOTHER THIS WHO

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:36.227
THEN PLEADED WITH HER TO BUY THE BAR.

00:21:36.227 --> 00:21:39.960
THE RATIONALE. >> IT WAS THE FIRST BAR HER

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:42.367
MOTHER EVER VISITED IN THE UNITED STATES AND HER MOTHER

00:21:42.367 --> 00:21:46.438
ALSO HAPPENED TO FAVOR TOSCA HOUSE CAPPUCCINO THE CHOCOLATE

00:21:46.438 --> 00:21:49.708
A CONCOCTION THAT ACTUALLY CONTAINS NO COFFEE.

00:21:49.708 --> 00:21:51.376
SO JEANNETTE SOON TOOK OVER THE KEYS AND IT WAS OFF TO THE

00:21:51.376 --> 00:21:54.376
RACES. THROUGH THE YEARS, TOSCA

00:21:54.578 --> 00:21:57.849
REGULARLY WELCOMED CELEBRITIES OF ALL STRIPES JAY-Z, FRANCIS

00:21:57.849 --> 00:22:02.520
FORD COPPOLA, LEBRON JAMES, BILL MURRAY, HUNTER THOMPSON.

00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:06.257
BUT MANAGED TO ALSO MAKE SURE THAT NEIGHBORHOOD REGULARS WERE

00:22:06.257 --> 00:22:09.393
WELCOME. THAT SUMMED UP JEANNETTE WHO

00:22:09.393 --> 00:22:13.331
JOHN MOSCONI DESCRIBED AS SIMULTANEOUSLY QUOTE BOTH FANCY

00:22:13.331 --> 00:22:17.602
AND DOWN TO EARTH. TOSCA WAS A LIVING ROOM WHERE

00:22:17.602 --> 00:22:21.806
BALLET DANCERS AND BUSINESSMEN, COPS AND POETS, LONGSHOREMEN

00:22:21.806 --> 00:22:25.276
AND MOVIE STARS ALL ANSWERED TO JEANNETTE AND HER PARTNER

00:22:25.276 --> 00:22:29.213
AND PROVIDING ENTERTAINMENT WAS A MASSIVE JUKEBOX FILLED WITH

00:22:29.213 --> 00:22:32.684
HUNDREDS OF SONGS THAT SHE EACH HANDPICKED.

00:22:32.684 --> 00:22:36.621
>> EACH SELECTION WAS SCRAWLED IN WRITING THAT SHE TOOK PRIDE

00:22:36.621 --> 00:22:37.822
IN BEING THE ONLY ONE ABLE TO ACTUALLY READ.

00:22:37.822 --> 00:22:40.492
SHE FAVORED OPERA MELODIES AND DEAN MARTIN.

00:22:40.492 --> 00:22:44.895
THANKFULLY, JEANNETTE INCLUDED IN THOSE HUNDREDS OF SONGS ALSO

00:22:44.895 --> 00:22:48.365
LAY MIO ON THE JUKEBOX, WHICH IS A FAMOUS NEAPOLITAN LOVE

00:22:48.365 --> 00:22:49.367
SONG. AND THAT'S IMPORTANT BECAUSE

00:22:49.367 --> 00:22:53.370
THAT'S THE NUMBER THAT BONO SPECIFICALLY REQUESTED WHEN HE

00:22:53.370 --> 00:22:56.241
SHOWED UP AT TOSCA CAFE. ONE NIGHT WHILE AFTER CLOSING

00:22:56.241 --> 00:23:00.440
TIME. HE THEN PROCEEDED TO JUMP ON

00:23:00.440 --> 00:23:01.379
THE BAR BELT OUT THE BALLOT AND EVER SINCE HE WOULD SAY

00:23:01.379 --> 00:23:04.249
THAT TOSCA CAFE WAS HIS FAVORITE HAUNT IN SAN

00:23:04.249 --> 00:23:07.249
FRANCISCO. >> JANETTE WAS GENEROUS OUTSIDE

00:23:08.322 --> 00:23:09.456
THE BAR TOO. SHE WAS A FOUNDING BOARD MEMBER

00:23:09.456 --> 00:23:12.126
OF NORTH BEACH CITIZENS AND SHAPED THEIR EARLY WORK

00:23:12.126 --> 00:23:15.462
