00:23:15.462 --> 00:23:16.730
NEIGHBORHOOD. SHE ALSO SERVED ON THE BOARD OF

00:23:16.730 --> 00:23:19.800
THE SAN FRANCISCO INTERNATIONAL FILM FESTIVAL.

00:23:19.800 --> 00:23:23.537
>> JANETTE WAS PROPOSED TO IN THE BOOTH AT TOSCA AND THE

00:23:23.537 --> 00:23:27.274
COUPLE LATER DECIDED TO DIVORCE AT A BOOTH IN TOSCA.

00:23:27.274 --> 00:23:30.677
YEARS LATER I'M TOLD IT WAS A DIFFERENT BOOTH THOUGH.

00:23:30.677 --> 00:23:34.481
SHE ONCE SAID OF TOSCA IT'S LIKE A NEIGHBORHOOD BAR EXCEPT

00:23:34.481 --> 00:23:37.684
THE ENTIRE CITY IS THE NEIGHBORHOOD.

00:23:37.684 --> 00:23:41.288
>> JANETTE MADE A SINGLE ROOM IN NORTH BEACH FEEL LIKE THE

00:23:41.288 --> 00:23:42.689
CENTER OF THE WORLD AND SHE MADE SURE THAT EVERYONE WHO

00:23:42.689 --> 00:23:46.930
WALKED INTO IT BELIEVED THAT THEY BELONG THERE.

00:23:46.930 --> 00:23:50.230
>> THAT WAS HER POWER. >> REST IN PEACE.

