00:28:35.861 --> 00:28:39.531
COMPENSATION FOR MANY FUTURE CLAIMS NEWLY FILED CLAIMS,

00:28:39.531 --> 00:28:42.935
REASSESSMENTS OR REEVALUATION EVEN OF SOME EXISTING RATINGS

00:28:42.935 --> 00:28:46.471
ARE GRANDFATHERED. WE SHOULD BE CLEAR CUTTING

00:28:46.471 --> 00:28:47.672
