00:28:47.672 --> 00:28:50.876
REDUCING COMPENSATION AVAILABLE TO VETERANS WHO FILE LATER IS

00:28:50.876 --> 00:28:54.100
STILL CUT AND FUNDING ONE SET OF VETERANS BENEFITS BY

00:28:54.100 --> 00:28:57.503
REDUCING EARNED BENEFITS FOR OTHER DISABLED VETERANS IS THE

00:28:57.503 --> 00:28:58.638
